\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.1}{\ignorespaces Age-group profiles of six linguistic/conversational features in children and age-prompted LLMs in single-turn testing. We compare actual human data from the child-caregiver dataset CHILDES vs. LLMs playing a child. Models include two LLMs (GPT-4o, Llama 3) in zero-shot and 3-shot settings. Points represent averages across all utterances and conversations, and ranges represent 95\% confidence intervals.}}{67}{figure.caption.63}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:child_single}{{5.1}{67}{Age-group profiles of six linguistic/conversational features in children and age-prompted LLMs in single-turn testing. We compare actual human data from the child-caregiver dataset CHILDES vs. LLMs playing a child. Models include two LLMs (GPT-4o, Llama 3) in zero-shot and 3-shot settings. Points represent averages across all utterances and conversations, and ranges represent 95\% confidence intervals}{figure.caption.63}{}}
